    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not sure what \"being a burden on yourself\" even means. i just mean that everything feels so heavy and pointless. if i'm just a source of stress for the people i love, wouldn't things actually be better for them if i just stopped being a factor? it feels like the most selfless thing i could ever do is just... not be an obstacle in their way anymore. is that a crazy thought?",
